This product includes recognition logic derived from Microsoft Presidio
(https://github.com/data-privacy-stack/presidio), licensed under the MIT
License, Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation.

Specifically, the following were adapted:

  · the scored-pattern model (multiple weighted variants per entity, context
    words raising confidence, checksum validation as a score modifier)
  · check-digit algorithms and pattern shapes for PESEL, the German
    Steueridentifikationsnummer, the Italian codice fiscale, the Spanish
    NIF and NIE, the Swedish personnummer, the Finnish henkilötunnus, the
    UK NHS number and NINO, the US SSN, ITIN and ABA routing number,
    and the IBAN country tables
